{"id":"7babd482d5079594","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega.md","title":"ZFC Model Nonstandard Omega","display":"df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega — ZFC Model Nonstandard Omega","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega","aliases":["58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega"],"display":"df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega — ZFC Model Nonstandard Omega","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega — ZFC Model Nonstandard Omega"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (carrier of a model of set theory, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak M_M\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak M_M\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle\\)</span> (the associated membership structure)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span> (the language of set theory)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\">\\(\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\)</span> (the internally defined natural-number object)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M}\">\\(\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\)</span> (interpretation of the standard numeral <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\)</span> (model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (the set-coded ZFC theory in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in\\)</span>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}omega}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\exists a\\in\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a\\neq\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}omega}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\exists a\\in\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a\\neq\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The internal object <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\">\\(\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\)</span> and the standard numerals are interpreted in the same structure. The carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is not itself used as a satisfaction structure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$M$ (carrier of a model of set theory, see [[../batch09/58-df-model.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Model}_S$ (model predicate, see [[../batch09/58-df-model.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak M_M\\coloneqq\\langle M,\\in\\cap M^2\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M}","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Model}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model\\text{-}nonstandard\\text{-}omega}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcModelNonstandardOmega}_S(M)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Model}_S(\\mathfrak M_M,\\mathrm{ZFC},\\mathcal L_\\in)\\land\\exists a\\in\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}\\;\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(a\\neq\\bar n^{\\mathfrak M_M})","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega^{\\mathfrak M_M}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1490,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2709","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega.md|58-df-zfc-model-nonstandard-omega]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","923884eb8fe4e61d","5045d216c83e75cb"]}